    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are in a mysterious place, <strong>Aquariums</strong> and <strong>Liminal Halls</strong> surround you... As you go deeper your mind starts to play tricks, did you see something move inside the tank? Or is it just your <strong>Thalassophobia</strong>?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3654850/extras/652461163505cc678985fea1ef70ec19.poster.avif?t=1746914065\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3654850/extras/652461163505cc678985fea1ef70ec19.webm?t=1746914065\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3654850/extras/652461163505cc678985fea1ef70ec19.mp4?t=1746914065\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you wander the\u00a0<strong>Aquariums</strong> you will have to go into the water and face the horrors inside the tanks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3654850/extras/105d964caa6a2d6dee760b64da123f1f.poster.avif?t=1746914065\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3654850/extras/105d964caa6a2d6dee760b64da123f1f.webm?t=1746914065\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3654850/extras/105d964caa6a2d6dee760b64da123f1f.mp4?t=1746914065\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stuck in a <strong>Liminal</strong> / <strong>Poolrooms</strong> / <strong>Backrooms</strong> facility, Its your job to find out who created this horrible place... You will encounter entities like the <strong>Divers</strong>\u00a0who seem to be in some kind of trance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3654850/extras/2293ccfe1987bb38ca38f48751fff399.poster.avif?t=1746914065\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3654850/extras/2293ccfe1987bb38ca38f48751fff399.webm?t=1746914065\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3654850/extras/2293ccfe1987bb38ca38f48751fff399.mp4?t=1746914065\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No enemies or UI but there are <strong>creatures</strong>\u00a0and <strong>divers</strong> that will jump out at you and disturb your sense of reality.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3654850/extras/1aa6b68eecdd81a9fa7078b536cf8c19.poster.avif?t=1746914065\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3654850/extras/1aa6b68eecdd81a9fa7078b536cf8c19.webm?t=1746914065\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3654850/extras/1aa6b68eecdd81a9fa7078b536cf8c19.mp4?t=1746914065\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>AQUARIUMS</strong> has seven unique chapters, each taking 10 to 30 minutes to play.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >AQUARIUMS is inspired by the internet phenomenons &quot;<strong>Liminal spaces</strong>&quot;, &quot;<strong>Found footage</strong>&quot;, &quot;<strong>Thalassophobia&quot;\u00a0</strong>and &quot;<strong>Backrooms</strong>&quot; - specifically &quot;<strong>Backrooms Pools</strong>&quot; or &quot;<strong>Poolrooms</strong>&quot;.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
