internet phenomenons &quot;<strong>Liminal spaces</strong>&quot;, &quot;<strong>Found footage</strong>&quot;, &quot;<strong>Thalassophobia&quot;\u00a0</strong>and &quot;<strong>Backrooms</strong>&quot; - specifically &quot;<strong>Backrooms Pools</strong>&quot; or &quot;<strong>Poolrooms</strong>&quot;.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
